{"overview":"داستان وانگ لین، مرد جوانی عادی در روستا را روایت می‌کند که دلش می‌خواهد به سوی جاودانگی پیش رود؛ هدف او نه تنها طول عمر است بلکه رهایی از حشرات پنهان پشت آن نیز می‌باشد. او به انسانیت ایمان راسخ دارد و با صلاحیت‌های متوسط وارد مسیر پرورش می‌شود؛ پس از فراز و نشیب‌ها، با ذهن حکیمانه‌اش به تدریج به اوج می‌رسد و با قدرت خود در دنیای پرورش مشهور می‌شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"It tells the story of Wang Lin, an ordinary young man in the countryside, who is moved by his heart and cultivates against immortality. His pursuit is not only for longevity, but also for getting rid of the ants behind it. He firmly believed in human beings and entered the path of cultivation with mediocre qualifications. After experiencing ups and downs, with his wise mind, he gradually reached the pinnacle and became famous in the cultivation world with his own strength.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":200,"y":2023,"poster":"/jNi6szgL3KwMuVExxockGNT4Wzq.jpg"}],"episodes":200,"crew":["石头熊","冯毅","耳根"],"crew_en":["TouXiong Shi","Yi Feng","Ergen"],"countries":["CN"],"cast":[{"name":"史泽鲲","role":"王林 (voice)","photo":"/1O3W2fPIfMTMo6cFpUnxvhivJje.jpg","en":"Shi Zekun"},{"name":"Huilin Zhang","role":"李慕婉 (voice)","photo":"/7zB8NhqoZzMoEQpQDOAJIfdgVYV.jpg","en":"Zhang Huilin"},{"name":"Wentao Chang","role":"司徒南 (voice)","photo":"/s9jQXrUzbtMXA6d5iZkgQ6nGJ5N.jpg","en":"Chang Wentao"},{"name":"刘思岑","role":"许立国 (voice)","photo":"/8AKjKsjULYhCw0zkaVNQHa1V65X.jpg","en":"Liu Sicen"},{"name":"白雪岑","role":"凤栾 (voice)","photo":"/hU7V64dz0qruxptwUeLQnkJiMcD.jpg","en":"Bai Xuecen"},{"name":"王婧兒","role":"柳眉(voice)","photo":"/rjF80jyrr7p3TTztafwDrSdAzKQ.jpg","en":"Wang Jinger"},{"name":"乔苏","role":"周茹(voice)","photo":"/joz3baiQTwIMy9nqbeG59CkiT2L.jpg","en":"Qiao Su"}],"trailer":"CbcJ_0XG_Sc","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/223911/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLy